    {
      "id": "claim_5da929644bf546dba7d91a93e001507b",
      "statement": "The browser calls the Ulabase service directly, so the service's origin-allowlist feature decides which origins it answers: setup adds the app URL to allowed-origins without replacing other origins and installs the feature when it is missing.",
